{x_vidgames
    {message
        output={@
You inspect the video games.
Most of them are relics of bygone eras, perfectly reproduced. You recognize
one of them: Asteroids. WELL before your time.

Two of the games have signs posted on them, indicating that they are
Out of Order.

- Spheros
- Metroid

        }
    }
}

{x_spheros
    {message
        output={@
You examine the Spheros arcade game.
It looks ordinary enough, but then you notice an odd looking panel set into
the back of the cabinet. You crouch down and remove the metal plate.
Inside the cabinet you see a faintly glowing translucent orb.

        }
    }
}

{x_metroid
    {message
        output={@
You look at the Metroid game. You vaguely remember hearing about this game.
But it has been so long you just know it is some kind of Sci-Fi game.
You don't see anything odd about it.

        }
    }
}















{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_vidgame))
    {act, logic=x_vidgames, tags=!_type|room }
}

{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_spheros))
    {act, logic=x_spheros, tags=!_type|room }

    {set, logic=[room]((orb_found)), output=true }
}

{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_metroid))
    {act, logic=x_metroid, tags=!_type|room }
}
